===Etymology===
From Common Germanic ''*dragan'', whence also Old English ''[[dragan]]'' ( > English ''[[draw]]''), Old Frisian ''[[#Old Frisian|draga]]'', ''[[drega]]'', Old Saxon ''[[dragan]]'' ( > Dutch ''[[dragen]]''), Old High German ''[[tragan]]'' ( > German ''[[tragen]]''), Gothic [[𐌳𐍂𐌰𐌲𐌰𐌽]] (dragan).

===Verb===
'''draga'''

# to [[draw]], [[drag]], [[pull]]

